      "Resolution stops at Trellis Analytics GmbH. The chain is known to continue — a named entity with no retrieved record — and the honest report is where it stopped and why, which is a limit of our holdings rather than of the German register. That is the not_held_or_unreachable case decisions/004 made expressible as a standing gap.\n",
      "Contrast with DE officers on the same record, which is not_published. One record carrying both non-adverse reasons, distinguishable only by where each resolves from.\n",
      "The foreign address has null structured fields. Per-field coverage is not theoretical here — deliverability and property type cannot run against it, while the US address resolves normally.\n",
      "No UBO data exists (doc 08). Ownership is implied from what the filings name, never confirmed. The assessment must not present the chain as ownership resolved.\n"
